&lt;li&gt;Work with wider technical teams on the design, deployment and continuous improvement of infrastructure of our products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a technical domain leader, provide technical guidance to your team and own the delivery of features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in raising our standard of engineering excellence by implementing standard methodologies for architecture, coding, testing, and deployment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
