&lt;li&gt;Conduct thorough root cause analyses using structured methodologies (5 Whys, Fishbone Diagrams, etc.) to understand underlying issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Map, analyse and document end-to-end operational processes, identifying inefficiencies, risks, control gaps and improvement opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement process improvements that enhance efficiency, reduce costs, and improve customer outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document RCA processes, findings and recommendations clearly and concisely&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand sampling strategies and how to create increased fidelity of outcome with lowest effort but maintaining statistical significance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Engagement &amp;amp; Change Delivery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong relationships with process owners and subject matter experts across different functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Articulate clear business cases using simple frameworks that make it easy to understand with the right level of technical detail for stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present clear recommendations and progress updates to leadership teams and stakeholders at all levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor the effectiveness of changes and track key metrics to ensure that issues are resolved and do not reoccur&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll be a successful Senior Process Improvement Analyst&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; at OVO if you…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
