&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Weekly office requirement:&lt;/strong&gt; Weds - weekly &lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employment type: &lt;/strong&gt;1 year maternity leave cover (November start date)&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Seniority level:&lt;/strong&gt; mid-senior&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;At GWI we’re always looking for extraordinary people who thrive on making an extraordinary impact. Right now we’re looking for a Director to oversee the Insight Services team based across our London, New York and Athens offices. If that’s you, and making a difference gets you out of bed in the morning, keep reading. It could be the start of something, well, extraordinary.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Sounds great, what will I be doing? 🤔&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As our Director of Insight Services:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be responsible for the insight function at GWI, leading four verticalised teams who are focused on uncovering data-driven narratives that shape how brands understand and engage their audiences. This team works across large-scale reporting projects, transforming GWI’s rich datasets into compelling insights, reports, and presentations that surface the unexpected and sharpen client strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll also partner closely with Revenue teams, contributing to RFPs, client relationships and proposals to support a strong pipeline of new opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A few things you’ll be responsible for:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading the global insight function - ensuring teams are crafting insights and analysis that are high-quality, accurate and inspire our clients&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Overseeing four verticalised teams, and directly line managing the lead of each vertical (Associate Director / Senior Insight Manager)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving forward the insight team strategy, including meeting efficiency objectives and promoting a consultancy approach with clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading on RFPs and proposals to showcase GWI’s insight capabilities and ensure we hit our targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working closely with Revenue teams across accounts, joining pitch calls, consulting with clients and recommending flexible approaches to pricing/packaging to ensure success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Running presentations, meetings and workshops confidently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Taking on external speaking opportunities, representing GWI and showcasing our insight capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing direct reports and ensuring they’re developing, learning and meeting their growth goals&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;It’s also fun; shaking things up is what working for GWI is all about. You’ll need to be flexible, comfortable with continuous change, and working in a high-tempo environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;What do I need to bring with me? 🧳&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll need to be able to demonstrate the core skills this role requires. Here’s what the team will be looking for in you:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;👉 Proven experience managing projects and client relationships, and working closely with client-facing teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;👉 A talent for data storytelling - translating numbers into narratives, and surfacing insights that challenge assumptions or reveal something new.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;👉 Experience developing, shaping, and delivering on strategic objectives — from setting the direction to executing it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;👉 Experience managing budgets and cost bases, with a commercial eye for margin and resourcing efficiency&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;👉 Exceptional attention to detail and a flair for writing clear, engaging content.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;👉 Comfortable running presentations and meetings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;👉 Willingness to represent GWI and its research in front of clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;👉 Experience at team and line management.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;👉 Excellent organization, time management, and collaboration skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;👉 An ability to adapt quickly to changing business requirements, requests, and commercial team needs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;Equally important is attitude. We want people who think big (to make an impact), ask why (to find a better way), and show respect (to everyone, at every level, all the time). Those are our values, and they’re a big part of what we’re looking for in you.&lt;br&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be part of a close-knit global team which encourages innovation, thinking big and close collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the biggest brands across the world.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to diverse projects that span multiple sectors and audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a fast-growth environment with opportunities to learn, grow and make a tangible impact.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;What We Offer 🧘&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At GWI, you’ll find meaningful work, visible impact, and a culture that empowers you to do your best. Our package includes:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time to recharge – 25 days’ annual leave, plus office closures over the holidays.&lt;/li&gt;
