&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We want to get to know you and have a genuine conversation, so the use of AI tools or assistance during live interviews is strictly prohibited and will result in immediate disqualification from the process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
