&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role: &lt;/strong&gt;Our distributed platform combines high-performance storage, compute, and service layers for processing and serving massive, structured, time-series datasets - built in C++ with a distributed system architecture, real-time streaming, RPC-based data transfer, and columnar on-disk storage that powers data processing and analytics workflows.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, develop, and maintain core components across our distributed storage, compute, and service platforms - including storage engines, query and compute execution, RPC/networking layers, and distributed coordination (routing, partitioning, replication).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with internal stakeholders across research and engineering teams to translate data-access, compute, and performance requirements into concrete design and implementation work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate and resolve production issues - from correctness bugs to performance regressions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in code review, system design, feature development, and productionization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
