&lt;li&gt;7+ years software solutions sales to the UK National Health Service, with a good understanding of data challenges, interoperability and standards within the NHS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using AI tools and data-driven insights to improve sales efficiency, pipeline management, forecasting accuracy, and overall sales outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
